@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<div style="background-color: black; width: 100%; height: 150px;"></div>
<div class="container">
    <div class="privacy-container">
        <h1 class="text-center mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Welcome to HotelBooker! Your privacy is very important to us. This privacy policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your personal data when you use our services. We are committed to safeguarding your data and privacy.</p>

        <section class="mt-5">
            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>We collect various types of information to provide and improve our services:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Personal Identification Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, mailing address, and any other information you provide to us.</li>
                <li><strong>Booking Details:</strong> Hotel preferences, check-in/check-out dates, special requests, and payment information, including credit card details.</li>
                <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, device information, and usage patterns, including pages visited and the time spent on our website.</li>
                <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> We may collect information about your location if you allow us to access your location data.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-5">
            <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>Your information is used to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Process hotel bookings and manage your requests efficiently.</li>
                <li>Improve the user experience and enhance our services based on user feedback and usage patterns.</li>
                <li>Send notifications, promotions, and updates that are tailored to your preferences.</li>
                <li>Conduct market research and analysis to better understand customer needs.</li>
                <li>Comply with legal obligations and protect our rights and the rights of others.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-5">
            <h2>3. Data Sharing and Security</h2>
            <p>We ensure that your data is protected by:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Encrypting sensitive information during transmission using SSL technology.</li>
                <li>Storing data on secure servers with advanced security measures.</li>
                <li>Limiting access to authorized personnel who are trained in data protection.</li>
                <li>Regularly reviewing our data collection, storage, and processing practices to ensure compliance with current laws.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>We do not sell or share your data with third parties except for providing necessary services, complying with legal obligations, or with your explicit consent.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-5">
            <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
            <p>We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Remember your preferences and settings for future visits.</li>
                <li>Analyze traffic and usage patterns to improve our website.</li>
                <li>Provide personalized advertisements and content based on your preferences.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You can adjust your browser settings to reject cookies if you prefer. However, this may limit some features of our website.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-5">
            <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>You have the right to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Access, update, or delete your personal information at any time.</li>
                <li>Opt-out of receiving marketing emails and information.</li>
                <li>Request a copy of your personal data in a commonly used, structured format.</li>
                <li>Lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority if you believe your rights have been violated.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>To exercise these rights, please contact us using the details provided below.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-5">
            <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for operational, legal, or regulatory reasons. Any changes will be posted on this page, and you will be notified by email if any significant changes occur. We encourage you to review this policy periodically for the latest information on our privacy practices.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-5">
            <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>We may employ third-party companies and individuals to assist with our services ("Service Providers"), provide services on our behalf, perform related services, or help us analyze how our services are used. These third parties will only have access to your personal data to perform these tasks on our behalf and are obligated not to disclose or use it for any other purpose.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-5">
            <h2>8. Data Retention</h2>
            <p>We will retain your personal information only for as long as necessary for the purposes outlined in this privacy policy. We will retain and use your personal information to the extent necessary to comply with our legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements and legal policies.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-5">
            <h2>9. International Data Transfer</h2>
            <p>Your information, including personal data, may be transferred to — and maintained on — computers located outside your state, province, country, or other governmental jurisdiction where data protection laws may differ from those of your jurisdiction. If you are outside Vietnam and choose to provide information to us, please note that we transfer data, including personal data, to Vietnam and process it there.</p>
            <p>Your consent to this privacy policy following the submission of such information represents your agreement to that transfer.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-5">
            <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this privacy policy, please contact us at:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> Khoa0255@gmail.com</li>
                <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +84 945 999 917</li>
                <li><strong>Address:</strong> 82 Dịch Vọng Hậu, Cầu Giấy, Hà Nội</li>
            </ul>
            <p>We are committed to addressing your requests and concerns promptly.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
